# Regenerable RUL-002 acceptance evidence (the validated ZIP is the immutable review delivery)
evidence/tickets/RUL-002/*
!evidence/tickets/RUL-002/.gitkeep

# Regenerable DAT-003 acceptance evidence (PLAN is the durable implementation ledger)
evidence/tickets/DAT-003/*
!evidence/tickets/DAT-003/PLAN.md

# Regenerable FPL-004 acceptance evidence (PLAN is the durable implementation ledger)
evidence/tickets/FPL-004/*
!evidence/tickets/FPL-004/PLAN.md
